  generalInfo: "KOAH, hava yollar\u0131nda daralma ile ilerleyen kronik bir solunum
    yolu hastal\u0131\u011F\u0131d\u0131r. Hastalarda nefes darl\u0131\u011F\u0131,
    \xF6ks\xFCr\xFCk ve balgam s\u0131k g\xF6r\xFClen belirtilerdendir."
  symptomsInfo: "Nefes darl\u0131\u011F\u0131 mevcut olmas\u0131, balgaml\u0131 \xF6ks\xFCr\xFCk,
    hafif h\u0131r\u0131lt\u0131 ve halsizlik mevcut olmas\u0131 KOAH\u2019ta s\u0131k
    g\xF6r\xFClen belirtilerdendir. Baz\u0131 hastalarda eforla \xF6ks\xFCr\xFCk
    art\u0131\u015F\u0131 g\xF6r\xFClebilir."
